2026-07-27T09:10:46.1944169Z i /tmp/RtmpDv5QGE/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:10:46.1944631Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:10:46.1945079Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:10:46.1945443Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:10:46.1946008Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:10:46.1946857Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:10:46.1947935Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
